# Positive build-context allowlist: runtime, public documentation and metadata only.
**
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!SECURITY.md
!requirements-lock.txt
!requirements-api-lock.txt
!src/
!src/person_engine/
!src/person_engine/**/
!src/person_engine/**/*.py
!docs/
!docs/*.md
!docs/*.json
# Reassert exclusions, including anything accidentally nested below src/docs.
**/.git/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/.venv/**
**/.env*
**/*.pyc
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
**/*-wal
**/*-shm
**/*.onnx
**/*.npz
**/*.npy
**/workspaces/**
**/artifacts/**
**/evidence/**
**/models/**
**/media/**
**/logs/**
**/temp/**
**/snapshots/**
